CommandString.description:
One or more @COMMAND directives separated by ' ; '.

Portraits (three independent slots — each pulls <portrait_id> from the portrait deck of THIS node's 'name' character):
  @SHOW_PORTRAIT <portrait_id>   @HIDE_PORTRAIT   → CharacterPortraitMain (drawn in front)
  @SHOW_EXTRA <portrait_id>      @HIDE_EXTRA      → CharacterPortraitExtra (middle)
  @SHOW_EXTRA2 <portrait_id>     @HIDE_EXTRA2     → CharacterPortraitExtra2 (back)

UI:
  @SHOW_SLIDESHOW <path>         @HIDE_SLIDESHOW
  @SHOW_SCENE <slide_id>         @HIDE_SCENE
  @SHOW_ZONE <Location/SubPath>  (expands to res://Narrative/DialogScenes/Locations/…tscn)
  @CLEAR_ALL

Audio:
  @PLAY_MUSIC <path>             @STOP_MUSIC    @FADE_MUSIC_OUT
  @MUSIC_CLIP <index_or_name>
  @PLAY_AMBIENCE <tag> <path>    @STOP_AMBIENCE <tag>    @STOP_ALL_AMBIENCE

World / time:
  @CHANGE_LOCATION <area_key>    @LOCATION_CHANGE <area_key>
  @SET_SCENE_FROM <scene_id>
  @SET_TIME day|night

Combat / encounter:
  @START_COMBAT [enemy_path]     @LEAVE_ENCOUNTER

Shop:
  @OPEN_BARTER <res://Resources/Shops/…tres>

Currency:
  @add_ore <n>        @remove_ore <n>
  @add_crowns <n>     @remove_crowns <n>
  @add_drots <n>      @remove_drots <n>

Items:
  @add_item <Items/path.tres> [qty]    @remove_item <Items/path.tres> [qty]

Reputation / horny:
  @add_reputation <npc_id> <n>    @remove_reputation <npc_id> <n>
  @add_horny <npc_id> <n>         @remove_horny <npc_id> <n>

Player:
  @HEAL_PLAYER <n>    @HEAL_PLAYER_FULL

Logbook:
  @ADD_LOGBOOK <entry_id>    @COMPLETE_LOGBOOK <entry_id>

Special:
  @RECORD_SPECIES_SEX [species_id]
